OL,3,CProgramme listings for SAT 9 MAY
OL,4,G1300FKey Changes: Radio 3's Essential
OL,5,     FHistory of Classical Music
OL,6,     GVenice, 1501. In a canal-side
OL,7,     Gworkshop, Petrucci produces the
OL,8,     Gfirst printed book of music.
OL,9,G1400FRecord Review
OL,10,     GAndrew McGregor with the best new
OL,11,     Gclassical releases, joined by
OL,12,     Gguest reviewers Lucy Parham and
OL,13,     GKeelan Carew, who picks his
OL,14,     Gfavourite recording of Liszt's
OL,15,     GTranscendental Studies.
OL,16,G1600FSound of Cinema
OL,17,     GDiscover the best in film scores
OL,18,     Gand movie music every week with
OL,19,     GEdith Bowman- this week composer
OL,20,     GAnna Meredith talks about the
OL,21,     Gscore for Ex Machina in
OL,22,     GHarmonising Hollywood.
OL,23,Vppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
